The initial attempt against the original lock failed because base64ct 1.8.3
requires Edition 2024 support. After pinning base64ct 1.7.3, the next attempt
identified the same compatibility issue in zeroize 1.9.2. Both are pinned in
the resulting Cargo.lock to 1.7.3 and 1.8.1, respectively. The original lock
is preserved at Cargo.lock.before-optimizer. Failure and successful console
logs are preserved alongside this file.
